From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: saiththerobo <the.tom.sharp@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 07:56:16 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] clk: samsung: acpm: add a paired GPU clock for gs101

The Mali-G78 in gs101 is clocked from two DVFS domains, G3D for the
shader cores and G3DL2 for the top level and L2. Google's driver moves
them together from a fixed table and keeps G3DL2 at or above G3D
throughout (gpu_dvfs_set_new_level() in pixel_gpu_dvfs.c: "When clocking
down we must set G3D CLK first"). Setting the two clocks one after the
other from the GPU driver can't keep that order in both directions.

Add gs101 a "gpu" clock as gs201 and zumapro have: its rate is the
shader rate, and setting it moves G3DL2 to the paired level, raising it
first going up and lowering it last going down. The pairs are Google's
gs101 table (gpu_dvfs_table_v2 up to gpu_dvfs_max_freq, 800 MHz), with
the 151 and 202 MHz rows that stock's 250 MHz gpu_dvfs_min_freq leaves
out. Unlike gs201's, the clock is writable from the start: the levels
were run on a Pixel 6 Pro (raven) through devfreq.

The other gs101 clocks are unchanged.

Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
Signed-off-by: saiththerobo <the.tom.sharp@gmail.com>
---
 drivers/clk/samsung/clk-acpm.c | 33 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 1 file changed, 33 insertions(+)

diff --git a/drivers/clk/samsung/clk-acpm.c b/drivers/clk/samsung/clk-acpm.c
index 82dae93f4..93f4b89b6 100644
--- a/drivers/clk/samsung/clk-acpm.c
+++ b/drivers/clk/samsung/clk-acpm.c
@@ -102,9 +102,42 @@ static const struct acpm_clk_variant gs101_acpm_clks[] = {
 	ACPM_CLK("bo"),
 };
 
+/*
+ * gs101 GPU operating points: shader (G3D) rate and the top/L2 (G3DL2) rate
+ * paired with it, in kHz, from Google's gs101 GPU DVFS table
+ * (gpu_dvfs_table_v2 in gs101-gpu.dtsi, the levels up to its
+ * gpu_dvfs_max_freq of 800 MHz). Stock's gpu_dvfs_min_freq of 250 MHz
+ * leaves out the 151 and 202 MHz rows; they are kept, as gs201's are.
+ */
+static const struct acpm_clk_pair gs101_gpu_pairs[] = {
+	{ 151000, 302000 },
+	{ 202000, 302000 },
+	{ 251000, 434000 },
+	{ 302000, 434000 },
+	{ 351000, 603000 },
+	{ 400000, 603000 },
+	{ 471000, 603000 },
+	{ 510000, 750000 },
+	{ 572000, 750000 },
+	{ 701000, 885000 },
+	{ 762000, 996000 },
+};
+
+static const struct acpm_clk_paired gs101_acpm_paired[] = {
+	{
+		.name = "gpu",
+		.id = 5,	/* G3D: shader cores */
+		.id2 = 6,	/* G3DL2: top level and L2 */
+		.pairs = gs101_gpu_pairs,
+		.nr_pairs = ARRAY_SIZE(gs101_gpu_pairs),
+	},
+};
+
 static const struct acpm_clk_driver_data acpm_clk_gs101 = {
 	.clks = gs101_acpm_clks,
 	.nr_clks = ARRAY_SIZE(gs101_acpm_clks),
+	.paired = gs101_acpm_paired,
+	.nr_paired = ARRAY_SIZE(gs101_acpm_paired),
 	.mbox_chan_id = 0,
 };
 
